<title>UK: Acesita prices $150 mln eight-year bond. [CORRECTED 13:02 GMT]</title>
<headline>Acesita prices $150 mln eight-year bond. [CORRECTED 13:02 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ACESITA SA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     11.125    MATURITY ***15.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.60     PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.60     SPREAD    * +472 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 250	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.625</p>
<p> NOTES	EURO-144A</p>
<p>(Corrects the issue and reoffer price to 99.60 from 99.50, and the spread to +472 from +471 basis points.)</p>
<p>	  *OVER FIVE-YEAR W/I U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>		***PUT ON 15.OCT.01</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
